			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Katheryne"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 80040101,
					"content": "Ah, Traveler. Right on cue, hehe.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Katheryne"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040102,
					"content": "Hey Katheryne! Got any new commissions for us today? Also... how come you look so happy to see us? What have you done!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040103,
					"content": "I went to the shrine to draw a fortune slip earlier. The shrine maiden told me that \"it is the season for an unexpected reunion.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Katheryne"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040104,
					"content": "Katheryne? Drawing fortune slips at the shrine? ...Is it just Paimon, or is that the most unusual thing ever!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040105,
					"content": "Wait, no, that's not the unusual part — we're in Liyue! You went to Inazuma and back in a single day!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040106,
					"content": "Hehe, even I have a private life, you know.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Katheryne"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040107,
					"content": "Okay, so when you say \"unexpected reunion,\" you mean running into us, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040108,
					"content": "Who can say? But the anticipation of knowing that an unexpected reunion is due is making me happy to see everyone I cross paths with today.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Katheryne"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040109,
					"content": "Fair enough, even though we see each other pretty much every day... Whatever makes you happy.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040110,
						80040111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040110,
					"content": "An unexpected reunion...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040112
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80040112,
					"content": "#Wait, are you saying... Ohh, Paimon gets it, {NICKNAME}. Well, let's just hope the shrine maiden was right...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040113,
					"content": "#Fingers crossed we find {F#him}{M#her}.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040114,
					"content": "I'm sorry... Did I say something I shouldn't have? You both seem a little down.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Katheryne"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040115,
					"content": "Oh, it's nothing. Anyway, back to business. Do you have a new commission you want to give to us?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040116,
					"content": "Yes, as a matter of fact, I do. This one is from a miner. It seems to be related to investigating The Chasm.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Katheryne"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040117,
					"content": "Really? Does this mean The Chasm's not sealed off anymore?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040118,
					"content": "I will leave the requester to fill you in on all the relevant details. His name is Yuehui, and he should be at The Chasm right now.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Katheryne"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040119,
					"content": "Alright then, thanks Katheryne! We'll head there right away.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040120,
					"content": "Very well. Ad astra... abyssosque. Hmm, this time you are truly bound for the abyss. Good luck to you both.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Katheryne"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040111,
					"content": "Perhaps...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040112
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 800402,
			"completionStepIds": [
				800402
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"800402",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 800402,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Yuehui"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 80040201,
					"content": "Hi there! You must be \"Yuehui,\" right? We've been sent by the Adventurers' Guild.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040202,
					"content": "Ah, great, good to meet you. Yes, I was the one who posted that commission.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yuehui"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040203,
					"content": "Wait a second... You look kind of familiar. Are you a famous adventurer, or something?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040204,
						80040205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yuehui"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040204,
					"content": "It's complicated.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040206
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80040206,
					"content": "Oh, uh, alright then. I'll start by introducing myself. I'm Yuehui, a miner, and I received a Mining Permit for The Chasm just recently. I have a handful of other guys in my crew.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yuehui"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040207,
					"content": "Seriously? They actually give permits out for The Chasm?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040208,
					"content": "Yes, the folks over at Yujing Terrace finally came to their senses and are now allowing a limited amount of ore mining near the surface. We were among the first to gain approval.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yuehui"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040209,
					"content": "But some things have happened recently that put all the miners on edge.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yuehui"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040210,
					"content": "Really? What happened? We haven't heard anything.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040211,
					"content": "So... it's hard to say exactly how big of an issue it is. Could be something, could be nothing. The main thing is that it's just very... strange.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yuehui"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040212,
					"content": "While one of the miners was on a break, he suddenly noticed a few hilichurls walking his way. They seemed like they were in a daze or something.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yuehui"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040213,
					"content": "They walked right by him without giving him a single glance. They just made a beeline for the depths of The Chasm.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yuehui"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040214,
					"content": "After that, the miner started observing his surroundings more closely, and noticed the same thing happening time and time again.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yuehui"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040215,
					"content": "Hmm... are the hilichurls just curious? Maybe they just wanna take a peek inside...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040216,
					"content": "Not likely. The strange part is that in all the time this miner has been watching the hilichurls...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yuehui"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040217,
					"content": "...he's never seen any of them come back out.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yuehui"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040218,
					"content": "It seems to be a one-way trip. Once the hilichurls go in, they never emerge again.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yuehui"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040219,
					"content": "And it seems to be happening more and more frequently as of late.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yuehui"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040220,
					"content": "\"What are these hilichurls up to?\" \"What happens to them after they go inside?\" \"Is there a disaster brewing?\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yuehui"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040221,
					"content": "These are the kinds of thoughts going through the guys' heads now. Everyone's driving themselves crazy worrying about it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yuehui"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040222,
					"content": "Uhhh! Paimon's not surprised... Paimon feels spooked just hearing about it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040223,
						80040224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040223,
					"content": "I don't dare imagine what's going on inside The Chasm...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040225
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80040225,
					"content": "Exactly. The deepest fear is the fear of the unknown, you know? So we have to get to the bottom of it before everyone can put their minds at rest.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yuehui"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040226,
					"content": "Do we... do we really wanna take this commission? Um, thanks Mr. Miner, Sir, we need to consider it first—",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040227,
					"content": "We'll take it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040228
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80040228,
					"content": "Hey! You could at least pretend to consider Paimon's opinion first!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040229,
						80040230
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040229,
					"content": "When strange things like this happen...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040231
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80040231,
					"content": "Oh, so that's where you're coming from. Hmm, well okay then, maybe we will find some clues about your twin.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040232
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040232,
					"content": "You'll really regret it if you don't go, huh?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040233
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040233,
					"content": "So, what's your verdict? Will you take the commission? No pressure, but I gotta say... I'm not loving the prospect of my Mining Permit going to waste.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040234
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yuehui"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040234,
					"content": "Yup, we'll take it. We're kinda curious ourselves now, too.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040235
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040235,
					"content": "Great. You're doing me an enormous service here. Now, let me give you the rough location that the hilichurls keep heading to...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Yuehui"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040230,
					"content": "I'm inclined to think the Abyss Order is involved.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040231
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80040224,
					"content": "\"Strange\" is definitely the right word...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040225
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80040205,
					"content": "Never mind that. Let's focus on the task at hand.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040206
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 800403,
