					"nextDialogs": [
						80040410,
						80040411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040410,
					"content": "Dainsleif!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040412
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80040412,
					"content": "The feeling is mutual. I certainly hadn't expected to meet you here, either.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040413,
					"content": "Long time no see, Dain... Wait, but how did you suddenly end up here in The Chasm?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040414,
					"content": "The Chasm? So, we're in the depths of The Chasm, are we. Interesting... This is one place where I have never set foot before.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040415,
					"content": "I have a lot of questions for you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040416
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80040416,
					"content": "I understand how you must feel. Last time, we met suddenly and parted hastily.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040417
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040417,
					"content": "Now our paths cross again... Fate, it seems, owes you an explanation.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040418,
						80040419
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040418,
					"content": "First, tell me what you're doing here.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040420
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80040420,
					"content": "That much should be self-explanatory. I came upon the trail of another Abyss Herald recently, and began pursuing it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040421
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040421,
					"content": "Unfortunately, I got as far as cornering him before he resorted to the same trick that they all do...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040422
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040422,
					"content": "I was hot on his heels when I followed him through the portal, but as usual, it was to no avail. It took me to the wrong place.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040423,
						80040424
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040423,
					"content": "So you had the same issue with the portal last time?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040425
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80040425,
					"content": "Correct. Based on my recent experiences, I can only conclude that the Abyss's portals are not simply pathways from point A to point B, but gateways to an entire network.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
